Package: bacipair
Type: Package
Title: BACI / Paired-DiD / Synthetic-Control Estimators for
    Carbon-MRV Audits
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Max",
           family = "Moldovan",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "max.moldovan@adelaide.edu.au",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474")))
Description: A reproducibility-by-construction toolkit for
    Before-After-Control-Impact (BACI) audits of carbon-MRV
    registers. Provides a staggered-treatment simulator with a known
    oracle ATT, a paired difference-in-differences estimator with
    proponent-cluster-robust standard errors, a time-varying
    synthetic-control comparator with simplex-constrained donor
    weights (Wang and Carreira-Perpinan, 2013), a proponent-level
    cluster bootstrap, a Goodman-Bacon (2021) staggered-DiD
    decomposition wrapper, and 'targets'-skeleton helpers for
    end-to-end pipeline reproducibility. Designed against the
    Macintosh et al. (2024) Australian Human-Induced Regeneration
    setting but applicable to any paired BACI register.
